    "message": "Add the logo, bubble popups and plain-language KPI notes to demo-v2\n\n- Show the supplied logo (house and name only) in the header top-left, served from a new static route and included in the package data\n- Open evacuee/staff status as a speech-bubble popup next to the click, scrollable inside, and let the people panel expand in-page\n- Replace developer wording in the KPI notes with plain explanations\n- Keep a copy of the logo as demo-v2-logo.jpg\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
